<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- The Frost Gun kit: a rifle whose bolts chill, with one ability (Flash Freeze, granted while
       it is equipped) and one resource (coolant, a tank on the gun). Mechanic agreed 2026-09-26;
       every number is a placeholder and a field here, in AG_FrostGun_Abilities.xml or in
       AG_FrostGun_Hediffs.xml. Distinct from the frost bomb (AG_FrostBomb, an area burst that
       freezes everyone): Flash Freeze is one target that has to be set up first.

       The shot: the gun's own verb, a normal aimed shot with Core's hit roll. Each bolt that hits a
       pawn adds one Chilled stack (AG_FrostGunChilled: -10% move speed per stack, up to 3, 10 s,
       refreshed on each hit). It uses no coolant. -->

  <!-- The bolt's damage: cold, so heat armour stops it, and a frostbite injury rather than a
       gunshot. Its own def because vanilla Frostbite is not external violence (a pawn shot with it
       would count as hurt by the weather), and AG_Cryo is the frost bomb's and freezes the area it
       hits. -->
  <DamageDef>
    <defName>AG_FrostGunCold</defName>
    <label>frost bolt</label>
    <workerClass>DamageWorker_AddInjury</workerClass>
    <externalViolence>true</externalViolence>
    <deathMessage>{0} has been frozen to death by a frost bolt.</deathMessage>
    <hediff>Frostbite</hediff>
    <harmAllLayersUntilOutside>true</harmAllLayersUntilOutside>
    <impactSoundType>Bullet</impactSoundType>
    <armorCategory>Heat</armorCategory>
    <makesBlood>false</makesBlood>
    <isRanged>true</isRanged>
    <makesAnimalsFlee>true</makesAnimalsFlee>
    <canUseDeflectMetalEffect>false</canUseDeflectMetalEffect>
  </DamageDef>

  <!-- The bolt. It is drawn from code (Projectile_FrostGun, FrostGunGraphics.Bolt): a pale core, a
       cold glow and a frost trail; the texture is the fallback. Speed 70 is 0.7 cells a tick, 42 a
       second. maxChilledStacks and chilledSeconds are what each hit does. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseBullet">
    <defName>AG_FrostGun_Bolt</defName>
    <label>frost bolt</label>
    <thingClass>RimArt.Projectile_FrostGun</thingClass>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>RimArt/FrostGun/Bolt</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>MoteGlow</shaderType>
    </graphicData>
    <projectile>
      <damageDef>AG_FrostGunCold</damageDef>
      <damageAmountBase>7</damageAmountBase>
      <armorPenetrationBase>0.10</armorPenetrationBase>
      <stoppingPower>0.5</stoppingPower>
      <speed>70</speed>
    </projectile>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimArt.FrostGunBoltExtension">
        <maxChilledStacks>3</maxChilledStacks>
        <chilledSeconds>10</chilledSeconds>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- The rifle. One bolt per shot, range 22, 0.9 s aim and 1.1 s cooldown (2 s between shots, so
       three hits fit well inside Chilled's 10 s), assault-rifle accuracy at range. Made at the
       machining table after AG_FrostGun research by the recipe BaseHumanMakeableGun's recipeMaker
       generates.

       The comps are listed with Inherit="False" because CompProperties_FrostGun is the weapon's
       CompEquippable (the coolant is an equipped gizmo, and the verb lives on it). The other comps
       of BaseHumanMakeableGun are repeated here; if it gains one, add it. weaponTags are cleared so
       no pawn kind spawns with one. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>AG_FrostGun</defName>
    <label>frost rifle</label>
    <description>A rifle that fires bolts of supercooled gas from a coolant tank under the barrel.\n\nNormal fire: 7 cold damage per bolt, range 22, one shot every 2 seconds. Each hit chills a creature: 10% slower per stack, up to 3 stacks, for 10 seconds, renewed by every hit. Normal fire uses no coolant.\n\nWhile it is equipped, the wielder can use Flash Freeze (10 coolant, 30 s cooldown): a beam that freezes one soaked or 3-times-chilled creature solid in ice for 5 seconds. It cannot move or act. The next hit it takes shatters the ice for 15 more damage.\n\nThe 30-unit tank refills 0.1 a second while the rifle is held, and 2 a second while the wielder stands somewhere below 0 °C.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>RimArt/FrostGun/FrostGun</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <uiIconScale>1.2</uiIconScale>
    <soundInteract>Interact_ChargeRifle</soundInteract>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <weaponTags Inherit="False" />
    <statBases>
      <WorkToMake>32000</WorkToMake>
      <Mass>3.8</Mass>
      <AccuracyTouch>0.65</AccuracyTouch>
      <AccuracyShort>0.75</AccuracyShort>
      <AccuracyMedium>0.65</AccuracyMedium>
      <AccuracyLong>0.50</AccuracyLong>
      <RangedWeapon_Cooldown>1.1</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
    </statBases>
    <costList>
      <Steel>70</Steel>
      <ComponentIndustrial>5</ComponentIndustrial>
    </costList>
    <recipeMaker>
      <researchPrerequisite>AG_FrostGun</researchPrerequisite>
      <skillRequirements>
        <Crafting>6</Crafting>
      </skillRequirements>
    </recipeMaker>
    <verbs>
      <li>
        <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass>
        <hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
        <defaultProjectile>AG_FrostGun_Bolt</defaultProjectile>
        <warmupTime>0.9</warmupTime>
        <range>22.9</range>
        <soundCast>Shot_ChargeRifle</soundCast>
        <soundCastTail>GunTail_Light</soundCastTail>
        <muzzleFlashScale>6</muzzleFlashScale>
      </li>
    </verbs>
    <comps Inherit="False">
      <li Class="CompProperties_Forbiddable"/>
      <li Class="RimArt.CompProperties_FrostGun">
        <capacity>30</capacity>
        <refillPerSecond>0.1</refillPerSecond>
        <refillPerSecondCold>2</refillPerSecondCold>
        <coldBelowCelsius>0</coldBelowCelsius>
        <abilities>
          <li>AG_FrostGun_FlashFreeze</li>
        </abilities>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Styleable"/>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Art">
        <nameMaker>NamerArtWeaponGun</nameMaker>
        <descriptionMaker>ArtDescription_WeaponGun</descriptionMaker>
        <minQualityForArtistic>Excellent</minQualityForArtistic>
      </li>
      <li>
        <compClass>CompQuality</compClass>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Biocodable"/>
    </comps>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>stock</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>9</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>barrel</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
          <li>Poke</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>9</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
      </li>
    </tools>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
